<p>Ya Hussain, Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Ya Hussain, Hussain Ya Hussain</p>

<p>Hussain Ya Hussain<br>
Ya Hussain, Hussain Ya Hussain</p>

<p>Mazloom Hussain Ki Hamsheera<br>
Islam Bachane Aayi Hai<br>
Shabbir Ka Sari Duniya Ko<br>
Paigham Sunane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>
Aashoor Ke Din Jis Bibi Ka<br>
Aabad Chaman Barbad Hua<br>
Sab Bhai Bhatije Maare gaye<br>
Samaan Jala Ghar-baar Luta Kuchh Bhi Na Bacha Lekin Zainab,<br>
Ye Deen Bachane Aayi hai</p>

<p>
Har Khutba Iska Majlis Hai<br>
Har Aansu Iska Maatam Hai<br>
Aashoor Basa Hai Aa&ntilde;kho&ntilde; Me<br>
Aur Dil Me Bahattar Ka Gham Hai<br>
Ye Ahle Aza Se Farsh e Aza,<br>
Ghar Ghar Bhijwane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>
Ham Par Patthar Barsate Ho<br>
Haste Ho Jashn Manate Ho<br>
Sayyad Ka Khoon Bahate Ho<br>
Aur Baghi-Baghi Kehte Ho<br>
Shabbir To Pak Namazi Hai,<br>
Ye Tum Ko Batane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>
Kaunain Ki Malka Ki Beti<br>
Wo Sharm o Haya Ki Shahzadi<br>
Haye! Shaam e Ghareeba&ntilde; Me Jiski<br>
Chadar Chheeni Thi Wo Bibi<br>
Duniya Ki Maa&ntilde; o Bahno Ko,<br>
Parda Sikhlane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>
Jisne Bhai Ki Gardan Par<br>
Chalte Huye Khanjar Dekha Tha<br>
Na Chhupne Doongi Khoon Tera<br>
Shabbir Se Kiska Wada Tha<br>
Wo Zainab Shaam Me Bhai Ka,<br>
Maatam Karwane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>
Sarwar Jab Baad Riha Hokar<br>
Jab Aayi Karbobala Muztar<br>
Haye! Peet Ke Sar Maatam Kar Kar<br>
Chillayi Bhai Ki Turbat Par<br>
Uth Bhai Hussain Tera Chehallum,<br>
Teri Bahan Manane Aayi Hai</p>

<p>Mazloom Hussain Ki Hamsheera<br>
Islam Bachane Aayi Hai<br>
Shabbir Ka Sari Duniya Ko<br>
Paigham Sunane Aayi HaiMazloom Hussain Ki Hamsheera<br>
